  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Development: Yunnan Rural Revitalization Demonstration Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is to sustainably keep poor and vulnerable households in the project area out of poverty. The development objective is to increase the opportunities for income generation among poor and vulnerable households in the project area and heighten the inclusiveness of the benefit-sharing mechanisms of agro-industries.</narrative>
  </description>
